[ti:41. Penny's Bag]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:00.290]Lesson 41 | 第41课
[00:03.512]Is that bag heavy /ˈhevi/, Mary? | 玛丽，那个包很重吗？
[00:05.940]Not very. | 不太重。
[00:07.310]Here. | 给。
[00:08.550]Put it on this chair. | 把它放在这张椅子上。
[00:10.970]What's in it? | 里面有什么？
[00:12.840]A piece of cheese /tʃiːz/. | 一块奶酪。
[00:15.660]A loaf of bread /bred/. | 一条面包。
[00:18.500]A bar of soap /səʊp/. | 一块肥皂。
[00:21.502]A bar of chocolate /ˈtʃɒklət/. | 一块巧克力。
[00:24.412]A bottle of milk /mɪlk/. | 一瓶牛奶。
[00:27.420]A pound /paʊnd/ of sugar /ˈʃʊɡə/. | 一磅糖。
[00:30.160]Half /hɑːf/ a pound /paʊnd/ of coffee /ˈkɒfi/. | 半磅咖啡。
[00:33.280]A quarter /ˈkwɔːtə/ of a pound /paʊnd/ of tea /tiː/. | 四分之一磅茶叶。
[00:36.710]And a tin /tɪn/ of tobacco /təˈbækəʊ/. | 和一听烟草。
[00:39.262]Is that tin /tɪn/ of tobacco /təˈbækəʊ/ for me? | 那听烟草是给我的吗？
[00:41.970]Well, it's certainly /ˈsɜːtnli/ not for me. | 嗯，它肯定不是给我的。
